# Chapter 6 Exercises 

## 6-1 If set A = {L M N O P} and set B = {P Q R S T}, what sets are generated by the follow
ing operations?
• A union B
• A union all B
• A intersect B
• A except B
### Answer: 
- A union B = {L,M,N,O,P,Q,R,S}
- A union all B = {L,M,N,O,P,P,Q,R,S}
- A intersect B = {P}
- A except B = {L,M,N,O}

## 6-2 and 6-3 Write a compound query that finds the first and last names of all actors and custom
ers whose last name starts with L. Sort the results from Exercise 6-2 by the last_name column.
### Answer (SQL QUERY)
  mysql> SELECT a.first_name fname, a.last_name lname
    -> FROM actor a
    -> WHERE a.last_name LIKE 'L%'
    -> UNION
    -> SELECT c.first_name, c.last_name
    -> FROM customer c
    -> WHERE c.last_name LIKE 'L%'
    -> ORDER BY lname,fname;
